      "default": 0,
      "options": [
        "Nearest",
        "N64 3-point"
      ],
      "help": "How the texture is smoothed. Nearest = hard square texels (PS1). N64 3-point = the soft, triangular blur of the Nintendo 64, which mixes only three texels instead of four."
    },
